# Local release staging. Every past welm-<version>.zip plus the generated
# appcast.xml live here — generate_appcast needs the full history of builds in
# one directory to produce a correct feed (and deltas later).
#
# These are release *assets*, uploaded to the `releases` tag with
# `gh release upload`. They are deliberately not tracked here: a committed copy
# alongside the uploaded one is an invitation to edit the wrong appcast.
#
# Losing this directory means re-downloading every published zip before the
# next generate_appcast run. Back it up.
dist/
